      "ordered_branches": [
        {
          "order": 1,
          "explanation": "Loads receipt fields by internal receipt number. NULL trailing status, including missing receipt, immediately deletes request by request ID and returns. Otherwise iterates criteria joined to operator metadata by name and alert type, for alert ID. Maps identifier/carrier/company/priority/receipt type/ship-from/source/line/value/weight fields into nvarchar50, then compares UPPER strings even for numeric data. Privately verified operator mapping rejects the inverse of each requested comparison; unrecognized operator falls back to equality. First failure ends loop and deletes request. No criteria leaves it intact. NULL comparison results do not mark failure; no warehouse/request ownership cross-check.",
